[[ ## document ## ]]
{
  "title": "Harbor Light FY2025 Fieldwork – Testing Framework & File Structure",
  "path": "Harbor_Light/FY2025/Fieldwork_Planning/Testing_Framework_and_File_Structure.docx",
  "document": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Harbor Light Assurance – FY2025 Fieldwork Testing Framework & File Structure"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Prepared by: Theo Brandt, Senior Accountant | Date: Fieldwork planning stage | Status: For internal team reference. This document cross-references the monthly close checklist (MCC) to map testing procedures, workpaper locations, and responsible parties."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Purpose & Scope"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "This framework governs how testing workpapers are organized, named, and cross-referenced for the Harbor Light FY2025 audit. It aligns each significant account and assertion with the monthly close checklist steps that generate the underlying source data, ensuring every PBC pull supports a specific control or substantive procedure."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. File Structure (Repository Root: /Harbor_Light/FY2025/)"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "01_Planning/ – risk assessment, materiality, PBC list (final, sent to Sylvia)",
          "02_Internal_Controls/ – walkthroughs, control testing, MCC tie-outs",
          "03_Substantive_Testing/ – by cycle: Payroll, Revenue, AP/Expenses, Fixed Assets, Cash",
          "04_Close_Checklist/ – monthly close checklist with sign-offs and evidence links",
          "05_Reporting/ – drafts, review notes, final clearance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Naming Convention"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Workpaper files follow: [Cycle]_[Procedure]_[Period]_[Version].xlsx. Examples: Payroll_Test_Q1Q2_FY25_v1.xlsx, Revenue_Cutoff_Q4_FY25_v2.xlsx. Each substantive file contains a “Source Ref” column referencing the MCC step number that produced the underlying data."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "4. Monthly Close Checklist (MCC) Cross-Reference"
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["MCC Step #", "MCC Description", "Related Testing Procedure", "Workpaper Location", "Status"],
        "rows": [
          ["MCC-01", "Record payroll accrual from time system", "Payroll completeness & accuracy – test Q1/Q2 batches", "03_Substantive_Testing/Payroll/", "Complete – no additional pulls needed"],
          ["MCC-02", "Reconcile payroll liabilities to GL", "Payroll liability tie-out to trial balance", "03_Substantive_Testing/Payroll/", "In progress"],
          ["MCC-03", "Review month-end bank reconciliations", "Cash existence & completeness", "03_Substantive_Testing/Cash/", "Not started"],
          ["MCC-04", "Post revenue journal entries from billing system", "Revenue occurrence & cutoff", "03_Substantive_Testing/Revenue/", "Planned – Q4 focus"],
          ["MCC-05", "Approve and record AP invoices", "Expense completeness & valuation", "03_Substantive_Testing/AP_Expenses/", "Planned"],
          ["MCC-06", "Run fixed asset depreciation", "Fixed asset existence & depreciation accuracy", "03_Substantive_Testing/Fixed_Assets/", "Planned"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "5. PBC List Integration"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The FY2025 PBC list (final, sent to Sylvia) explicitly covers Q1/Q2 payroll testing items. Each PBC request line carries the MCC step it supports; the tracker in 01_Planning/PBC_Tracker.xlsx logs request date, due date, receipt, and status. No timing tweaks were required; distribution occurred as planned."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "6. Testing Responsibilities & Review"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "Fieldwork lead (Theo): owns PBC tracker, payroll and cash testing, first-level review",
          "Senior associate (Desmond): revenue and AP testing, second-level review of payroll",
          "Staff (Imogen): fixed assets, document retrieval, MCC evidence filing",
          "Manager: final review of all substantive files before clearance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "7. Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "Complete payroll liability tie-out (MCC-02) by end of week",
          "Begin cash bank reconciliation testing (MCC-03) after close package received",
          "Hold Blue Fir payroll huddle – materials prepped; confirm attendees",
          "File OR notice log once received"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
[[ ## completed ## ]]
